summary: Quick MLS permissive + cloud-init AVC dump
description: |
    Diagnostic only (not CI). Install COPR selinux-policy-mls, switch to
    MLS in permissive mode with one reboot (no full fixfiles -F onboot),
    restart all cloud-init services, print ausearch AVCs since boot.

    Env: COPR_REPO (required).

prepare:
  - name: COPR MLS permissive switch
    how: shell
    script: $TMT_TREE/tmt/mls-cloudinit-avc-prepare.sh

discover:
  - name: cloudinit-avc
    how: shell
    tests:
      - name: /cloudinit-avc/run
        duration: 20m
        require:
          - audit
          - systemd
        test: $TMT_TREE/tmt/mls-cloudinit-avc-run.sh

execute:
  how: tmt
